<title>USA: Norfolk seeks Conrail holder list.</title>
<headline>Norfolk seeks Conrail holder list.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norfolk Southern Corp said in a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission on Wednesday that it requested access to Conrail Inc's shareholder list and other data so it can communicate with shareholders.</p>
<p>Norfolk, which launched a $100 a share cash offer for Conrail on October 24, said it wants to reach shareholders to solicit proxies against Conrail's plan to seek shareholder approval of a proposal to &quot;opt out&quot; of the Pennsylvania Control Transaction Law.</p>
</text>
